# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body - explain WHAT and WHY, not HOW>
#
# <footer - breaking changes, issue refs, co-authors>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, ci, build, revert
# Scopes: newsletter, sources, curator, scoring, docs
#
# Rules:
# - Use imperative mood ("add" not "added")
# - Don't capitalize first letter
# - No period at end of subject
# - Max 72 chars for subject, wrap body at 72
#
# Examples:
# feat(newsletter): add parallel source fetching
# fix(scoring): correct relevance weighting
# docs(vc): add commit message template
